<title>UK: Norway's Troll crude to load 8.2 mln bbls in May.</title>
<headline>Norway's Troll crude to load 8.2 mln bbls in May.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 8.2 million barrels of crude in May, a fraction more than the 8.0 million in April, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said the May programme comprised 14 cargoes, unchanged from April.  </p>
<p>The May programme consists of six cargoes of 600,000 barrels, four of 400,000 barrels, two of 500,000 barrels and two of one million barrels.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
